ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582650/extras/39d69cd4cdd4ca3e460bd3575f7ce507.poster.avif?t=1744895601\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582650/extras/39d69cd4cdd4ca3e460bd3575f7ce507.webm?t=1744895601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582650/extras/39d69cd4cdd4ca3e460bd3575f7ce507.mp4?t=1744895601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>As you interact with the diverse characters you meet along the way, you'll come to understand that your community is your home.<br><br>Help everyone and contribute your piece to the edifice, enabling everyone to live in harmony in an environment hostile to all civilizations due to over-exploitation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Game developed for All</strong></h2>Plane Toast made huge importance to create a game in which everyone can feel included, representing their vision of a world where communities help each other to overcome the environmental consequences of our world.  <br><br>Caravan SandWitch is written with an inclusive script, that represents a real community with its people and representation.  <br><br><strong>Accessibility options are available.</strong>",
